Conclusion TransUnion has acted unlawfully by re-adding the XXXX charge-off account to my credit report. This is a clear violation of FCRA provisions and my secured party rights under UCC laws. I expect swift corrective action to rectify this matter immediately.

I anticipate your prompt attention and response to this serious issue.

